msgid "2D RT Test: Searchlight Beam"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "サーチライト問題は、輻射輸送 (RT) ソルバの標準的なテスト問題です。境界の一部から細い光束 (サーチライト) を計算領域に入射させ、光束がどの程度広がらずに伝わるかを見ることで、短い特性法(short characteristics) {cite}`kunasz_1988JQSRT..39...67K` の数値拡散の大きさを確認します。"
msgstr "The searchlight problem is a standard test problem for radiative transfer (RT) solvers. A thin beam of light (the searchlight) is injected into the computational domain from part of the boundary, and we check the amount of numerical diffusion of the short characteristics method {cite}`kunasz_1988JQSRT..39...67K` by seeing how little the beam spreads as it propagates."

msgid "MISOのRTソルバは、離散化した方向ごとに輻射輸送方程式"
msgstr "The RT solver of MISO integrates the radiative transfer equation"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{dI}{ds} = -\\kappa \\left(I - S\\right)\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "を短い特性法で積分します。ここで$I$は輻射強度、$s$は光線に沿った距離、$\\kappa$は吸収係数、$S$は源泉関数です。角度積分にはCarlsonのA4求積 (24方向) を用います。"
msgstr "for each discretized direction with the short characteristics method. Here $I$ is the intensity, $s$ is the distance along the ray, $\\kappa$ is the absorption coefficient, and $S$ is the source function. For the angular integration we use Carlson's A4 quadrature (24 directions)."

msgid "Location"
msgstr ""

msgid "`demo/rt2d_searchlight/`"
msgstr ""

msgid "Geometry"
msgstr ""

msgid "$-0.5 \\leq x \\leq 0.5$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$-0.5 \\leq y \\leq 0.5$"
msgstr ""

msgid "$z$方向は1格子点のみで、2次元問題として扱います。"
msgstr "There is only one grid point in the $z$ direction, so the problem is treated as a 2D problem."

msgid "Setup"
msgstr ""

msgid "計算領域全体で吸収係数と源泉関数を一様に"
msgstr "We set the absorption coefficient and the source function uniformly over the whole computational domain to"

msgid ""
"\n"
"\\kappa = 1, \\quad S = 0.5\n"
msgstr ""

msgid "とします。`config.yaml` の `searchlight` セクションで変更できます。"
msgstr "They can be changed in the `searchlight` section of `config.yaml`."

msgid "Boundary Conditions"
msgstr ""

#, python-brace-format
msgid "$x$方向内側の境界 ($x = -0.5$) のうち $\\sqrt{y^2 + z^2} \\leq 0.2$ の範囲から、内向きの全方向に強度 $I = 1$ の輻射を入射させます。それ以外の境界からの入射強度は $0$ です。$y$方向と$z$方向は周期境界条件です。"
msgstr "From the part of the inner boundary in the $x$ direction ($x = -0.5$) with $\\sqrt{y^2 + z^2} \\leq 0.2$, radiation of intensity $I = 1$ is injected in all inward directions. The incident intensity from the other boundaries is $0$. The $y$ and $z$ directions have periodic boundary conditions."

msgid "入射させる境界面 (`boundary_face`)、半径 (`radius`)、入射強度 (`incoming_intensity`) は `config.yaml` で変更できます。"
msgstr "The boundary face of incidence (`boundary_face`), the radius (`radius`), and the incident intensity (`incoming_intensity`) can be changed in `config.yaml`."

msgid "Results"
msgstr ""

msgid "このデモは時間発展を行わず、輻射場が収束するまで反復して1回だけ出力します。可視化用のPythonスクリプトが用意されています。結果のプロットは `demo/rt2d_searchlight/figs` に保存されます。"
msgstr "This demo does not evolve in time; it iterates until the radiation field converges and writes the output only once. A Python script for visualization is provided. The plots of the results are saved in `demo/rt2d_searchlight/figs`."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "平均強度 $J = \\sum_r w_r I_r$ と輻射流束 $\\bm{F} = 4\\pi \\sum_r w_r \\bm{\\mu}_r I_r$ の3成分を$x$-$y$面に描きます。ここで$w_r$、$\\bm{\\mu}_r$はそれぞれ方向$r$の重みと方向余弦です。境界から入った光束が、離散化した方向に沿って分かれて進む様子と、吸収によって減衰しながら源泉関数の値 $S = 0.5$ に近づく様子が見えます。2次元問題なので $F_z$ は丸め誤差程度の値になります。"
msgstr "We plot the mean intensity $J = \\sum_r w_r I_r$ and the three components of the radiative flux $\\bm{F} = 4\\pi \\sum_r w_r \\bm{\\mu}_r I_r$ in the $x$-$y$ plane. Here $w_r$ and $\\bm{\\mu}_r$ are the weight and the direction cosine of direction $r$, respectively. You can see the beam entering from the boundary split and travel along the discretized directions, and approach the source function value $S = 0.5$ while being attenuated by absorption. Because this is a 2D problem, $F_z$ is at the level of rounding error."

